Description: UEFI Secure Boot key manager
 sbctl intends to be a user-friendly secure boot key manager capable of
 setting up secure boot, offer key management capabilities, and keep
 track of files that needs to be signed in the boot chain.
 .
 Features:
  * User-friendly
  * Manages secure boot keys
  * Live enrollment of keys
  * Signing database to help keep track of files to sign
  * Verify ESP of files missing signatures
  * EFI stub generation
  * JSON output
